  "title": "Pagaya Announces Timing of Second Quarter 2026 Earnings Release",
  "summary": "NEW YORK --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Jul. 9, 2026-- Pagaya Technologies Ltd. (NASDAQ: PGY) (“Pagaya”) will announce its second quarter 2026 earnings on July 30, 2026. A conference call to discuss those earnings will be held on the same day at 8:30 a.m. ET / 3:30 p.m. IST.",
